{"4120270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dustpocalypse", "steam_appid": 4120270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/1e5b2b980184c596c7724250019b8dd4.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" width=1170 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/1e5b2b980184c596c7724250019b8dd4.webm?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/1e5b2b980184c596c7724250019b8dd4.mp4?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wind stirs as a cute cat looks to the sky... the Dustpocalypse has arrived, bringing with it hordes of mutated dust monsters set to devour everything in their way. Not being able to attack anything themselves, <strong>Scrunkly</strong> must lure their trusty robo-vacuum around to kill everything for them in this <strong>challenging</strong>, <strong>highly replayable</strong> and most importantly, <strong>cute action roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/56a29211d9f3bda2804f3b34e6c834b3.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/56a29211d9f3bda2804f3b34e6c834b3.webm?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/56a29211d9f3bda2804f3b34e6c834b3.mp4?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to survival in this dust-eat-dust world is cooperating with your little robot buddy. You won't be able to <strong>damage enemies yourself</strong>, but will be able to <strong>lead your robo-vacuum around</strong> by spitting up trash at any time. Your robot friend will automatically <strong>shoot the closest enemy</strong>, and will also suck up any dust that drops from dead enemies to level up - which will give you different <strong>upgrades, items and guns</strong>. These can dramatically change the best way to survive, making each run wildly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/85bcd9387b8de813c0ca5ec8f8bfd8bc.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/85bcd9387b8de813c0ca5ec8f8bfd8bc.webm?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/85bcd9387b8de813c0ca5ec8f8bfd8bc.mp4?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what's the point of playing as a cute cat if you can't dress up? At the end of every run, all the dust you've collected will fill up the Battle Bar, which can unlock new synergistic items, run-changing guns and cute-as-heck cosmetics every level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Control Scheme</strong> - An active take on the Horde-Survival genre without giving the player guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Again! Again! Again!</strong> - Short 15~ minute runs and high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items</strong> - Inspired by more traditional roguelikes, passive items can radically change gameplay styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong> - Dress up Scrunkly however you want with over 100 cosmetics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Bar System</strong> - A battle pass with no FOMO, unlocked through causal gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Meow Technology </strong>- meow button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/11b5cb07c9754e80fdf1b0b55aceb8ca.apng?t=1780944036\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/11b5cb07c9754e80fdf1b0b55aceb8ca.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/1e5b2b980184c596c7724250019b8dd4.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" width=1170 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/1e5b2b980184c596c7724250019b8dd4.webm?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/1e5b2b980184c596c7724250019b8dd4.mp4?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wind stirs as a cute cat looks to the sky... the Dustpocalypse has arrived, bringing with it hordes of mutated dust monsters set to devour everything in their way. Not being able to attack anything themselves, <strong>Scrunkly</strong> must lure their trusty robo-vacuum around to kill everything for them in this <strong>challenging</strong>, <strong>highly replayable</strong> and most importantly, <strong>cute action roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/56a29211d9f3bda2804f3b34e6c834b3.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/56a29211d9f3bda2804f3b34e6c834b3.webm?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/56a29211d9f3bda2804f3b34e6c834b3.mp4?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to survival in this dust-eat-dust world is cooperating with your little robot buddy. You won't be able to <strong>damage enemies yourself</strong>, but will be able to <strong>lead your robo-vacuum around</strong> by spitting up trash at any time. Your robot friend will automatically <strong>shoot the closest enemy</strong>, and will also suck up any dust that drops from dead enemies to level up - which will give you different <strong>upgrades, items and guns</strong>. These can dramatically change the best way to survive, making each run wildly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/85bcd9387b8de813c0ca5ec8f8bfd8bc.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/85bcd9387b8de813c0ca5ec8f8bfd8bc.webm?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/85bcd9387b8de813c0ca5ec8f8bfd8bc.mp4?t=1780944036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what's the point of playing as a cute cat if you can't dress up? At the end of every run, all the dust you've collected will fill up the Battle Bar, which can unlock new synergistic items, run-changing guns and cute-as-heck cosmetics every level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Control Scheme</strong> - An active take on the Horde-Survival genre without giving the player guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Again! Again! Again!</strong> - Short 15~ minute runs and high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items</strong> - Inspired by more traditional roguelikes, passive items can radically change gameplay styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong> - Dress up Scrunkly however you want with over 100 cosmetics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Bar System</strong> - A battle pass with no FOMO, unlocked through causal gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Meow Technology </strong>- meow button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/11b5cb07c9754e80fdf1b0b55aceb8ca.apng?t=1780944036\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120270/extras/11b5cb07c9754e80fdf1b0b55aceb8ca.poster.avif?t=1780944036\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p>", "short_description": "Play as a cute cat leading their trusty robo-vacuum into battle against endless waves of mutated dust monsters. Master working together with your robot friend, and experiment with different builds to finally achieve the perfect run. Will you be able to conquer the Dustpocalypse?", "su